      "content": "oh it's been such a quiet day today… just me and the birds outside the window. i've been thinking a lot about my friend Dorothy, she passed in January you know. we used to call each other every Sunday without fail for 40 years. \n\ni don't really know what i'm still doing here sometimes. at 78 i feel like i've had my time, done what i was meant to do. my children have their lives. i'm not complaining, i just feel like… i'm ready, you know? whenever it's my time. i'm just waiting now i suppose",
